Project Title
Implement Client Script and UI Policy in ServiceNow Incident

## Objective
To improve the Incident form by using Client Scripts and UI Policies.

## Ideas
- Automatically populate incident fields.
- Make fields mandatory when required.
- Show or hide fields based on conditions.
- Make fields read-only when necessary.
- Improve the user experience of the Incident form.

## Proposed Solution
Use ServiceNow Client Scripts and UI Policies to control the behaviour of Incident form fields dynamically.

## Expected Outcome
The Incident form should work according to the defined conditions and provide a simple and user-friendly interface.
